[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ipy5q"]
script = ExtResource("8_e0tjo")
name = "Geno"
description = "Greedy and heartless, forever a stranger. Runs away from everything. Secretly an artist. Doesn't want to admit it.


SKILLS
Geno's skills are aspects of his instincts. Despite having a strong vocabulary, his actual executive function isn't very good. Can you see through the veil?

[b]Cage[/b]
16 bars of wrought iron between my id and the real world. 

[b]Good[/b]
Utilitarian Mathematical Philosophy in practice. Listening to the Good voice isn't always easy but it usually feels best later.

[b]Inspiration[/b]
Sacred Geometry haunts my dreams. One day, I must burn the crest into this physical plane.

[b]Rhetoric[/b]
More money more problems. I never go to bed without balancing my accounts and tying up all loose ends.

[b]Speed[/b]
At attention! I wasn't sleeping, I swear!

[b]Evil[/b]
There's something inside of me that I don't like. A desire to act with no values. And yet, I use it too much. Is there any escape?"
portrait = SubResource("PlaceholderTexture2D_e0tjo")
background = SubResource("AtlasTexture_xrijs")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bkv8l05n57om4"

