[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_k1q44"]
script = ExtResource("8_e0tjo")
name = "Reka"
description = "Well traveled, but still naïve in many ways. Overdramatic and overextending. Too young for this. Too old to still be acting like a kid.


HERO'S SKILLS
Reka's skills are split into 2 groups. 3 \"Hero's skills\" which represent her values, and \"Systems\" which counteract them. Don't be fooled. All have their utilities and shortcomings.

[b]Power[/b]
First pillar of the tragic hero. Never give up and always move with a clear goal.

[b]Body[/b]
Second pillar of the tragic hero. Care and cherish the self and others in both medicine and art.

[b]Soul[/b]
Third pillar of the tragic hero. Know one's limits and never be corrupted by temptation.

THE SYSTEMS
[b]Nervous System[/b]
Retreat, sidestep, connive, scheme, react erratically and never let Them know your next move.

[b]Integumetary System[/b]
Be attuned and obsessed with all things sensory. Seek out sounds, colors, and chemicals that make you feel fuzzy.

[b]Skeletal System[/b]
Maybe.. sometimes.. it's ok to give into your intrusive thoughts? Love, your skeleton."
portrait = SubResource("PlaceholderTexture2D_cwy78")
background = SubResource("AtlasTexture_xrcy2")
text_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bkv8l05n57om4"

